! AeroL.Airfoil V2.0.0 Powered by Zhao Zizhen
This file targets OpenWECD 1.0.2+ and stores the quasi-steady polar table used by AeroL.
===========  Airfoil information  (General data)  ===========
100                Thickness      - airfoil thickness to chord ratio (%)
1          ReyNum        - Reynolds number (-)
50                PMCentre       - pitching moment reference position (%)
"./IEA-15-240-RWT_AF00_Coords.txt"                Geometry       - airfoil geometry coordinate file
===========  Airfoil data  (Aerofoil Database) ===========
 1    InterpOrd  - Interpolation order to use for quasi-steady table lookup {1=linear; 2=cubic spline; default=1}
        200   NumAlf            ! Number of data lines in the following table
    Alpha      Cl      Cd        Cm
    (deg)      (-)     (-)       (-)
